steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1785753397
      nanos: 1527499
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Build a modern, clean, mobile-first educational website for \"Sneha Gupta (CA Finalist)\".\n\nThe design should be premium, minimal, elegant, and extremely easy for students to navigate. Avoid clutter. Use a white background with subtle blue accents (#2563EB) and soft gray tones. Rounded corners, clean typography, smooth animations, and professional spacing throughout.\n\nTechnology Stack:\n- Next.js 15 (App Router)\n- TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS\n- shadcn/ui\n- Lucide React Icons\n- React Hook Form\n- Zod Validation\n- Supabase (Authentication, PostgreSQL Database, Storage)\n- Razorpay Payment Gateway\n- Vercel Deployment\n\nThe website should include the following pages:\n\n====================\nHOME PAGE\n====================\n\nHero Section\n- Branding: Sneha Gupta (CA Finalist)\n- Professional portrait placeholder\n- Short introduction\n- Motivational headline\n- CTA buttons:\n  - Explore Courses\n  - Join Mentorship\n  - Book Strategy Session\n\nBelow the hero include\n\n\342\200\242 Why Study With Sneha\n\342\200\242 Featured Courses\n\342\200\242 Mentorship Programs\n\342\200\242 Strategy Session\n\342\200\242 Student Testimonials\n\342\200\242 FAQ\n\342\200\242 Contact Section\n\342\200\242 Footer\n\n====================\nCOURSES PAGE\n====================\n\nDisplay chapter-wise courses in beautiful cards.\n\nEach course card contains\n\n- Thumbnail\n- Chapter Name\n- Description\n- Duration\n- Price\n- Buy Now button\n\nCourse Detail Page\n\nInclude\n\n- Course description\n- Chapter list\n- Video Preview\n- Buy Now\n- PDF Notes\n- Question Bank PDF\n- Student Reviews\n\nAfter purchase\n\nStudents should get\n\n- Video Access\n- Download Notes\n- Question Bank\n- Progress Tracking\n- Continue Watching\n\n====================\nMENTORSHIP PAGE\n====================\n\nDisplay mentorship options\n\nCA Inter Sept 2026\n\nSingle Group\n\342\202\2711500\n\nBoth Groups\n\342\202\2712000\n\nCA Inter Jan 2027\n\nSingle Group\n\342\202\2713000\n\nBoth Groups\n\342\202\2714000\n\nEach mentorship page should include\n\n- Full Description\n- Benefits\n- Weekly Plan\n- Personal Guidance\n- Doubt Support\n- Timetable\n- FAQ\n- Enroll Now button\n\nAfter payment\n\nDisplay Student Information Form\n\nCollect\n\n- Name\n- Email\n- Mobile\n- Attempt\n- College\n- Current Preparation Level\n\n====================\nPERSONAL STRATEGY SESSION\n====================\n\nPrice \342\202\271799\n\nExplain\n\n- 1:1 Strategy Call\n- Personalized Study Planner\n- Subject-wise Planning\n- Backlog Recovery\n- Revision Plan\n- Remaining Days Action Plan\n\nInclude\n\nBook Now button\n\nBooking Form\n\nChoose\n\n- Date\n- Time\n- Contact Number\n\n====================\nSTUDENT REVIEWS\n====================\n\nBeautiful testimonial section\n\nSupport\n\n- Text Reviews\n- Images\n- WhatsApp Screenshots\n- Ratings\n\nAdmin should easily add more reviews.\n\n====================\nLOGIN\n====================\n\nAuthentication using Supabase\n\nEmail Login\n\nRegister\n\nForgot Password\n\n====================\nSTUDENT DASHBOARD\n====================\n\nAfter login students only see purchased products.\n\nDashboard contains\n\n- My Courses\n- Continue Learning\n- Progress Bar\n- Notes\n- Question Banks\n- Purchased Mentorship\n- Strategy Session Booking\n- Profile\n- Logout\n\n====================\nVIDEO PLAYER\n====================\n\nProfessional learning page\n\nFeatures\n\n- Large Video Player\n- Sidebar Chapter List\n- Previous\n- Next\n- Mark Complete\n- Resume Playback\n- Progress Bar\n\n====================\nADMIN PANEL\n====================\n\nCreate a protected admin dashboard.\n\nAdmin can\n\n- Upload Videos\n- Upload PDFs\n- Add Chapters\n- Create Courses\n- Edit Courses\n- Delete Courses\n- Change Prices\n- Manage Mentorship Programs\n- Manage Strategy Sessions\n- Add Testimonials\n- View Students\n- View Purchases\n- View Payments\n- Manage Users\n\n====================\nDATABASE\n====================\n\nCreate tables\n\nUsers\n\nCourses\n\nChapters\n\nVideos\n\nPDFs\n\nPurchases\n\nProgress\n\nMentorship\n\nStrategySessions\n\nTestimonials\n\nPayments\n\n====================\nPAYMENTS\n====================\n\nIntegrate Razorpay.\n\nAfter successful payment\n\n- Verify Payment\n- Save Purchase\n- Unlock Course\n- Send Confirmation Email\n\n====================\nDESIGN\n====================\n\nUse\n\n- Tailwind CSS\n- shadcn/ui\n- Framer Motion\n- Lucide Icons\n\nThe UI should feel similar to premium platforms like:\n- Unacademy\n- Physics Wallah\n- Graphy\n- Airtribe\n\nFeatures\n\n- Glassmorphism where appropriate\n- Beautiful gradients\n- Smooth animations\n- Mobile Responsive\n- Dark mode support\n- SEO optimized\n- Fast loading\n- Accessibility compliant\n\n====================\nCODE QUALITY\n====================\n\nUse reusable components.\n\nCreate folders for\n\n/components\n/app\n/lib\n/hooks\n/types\n/services\n/utils\n\nWrite clean production-ready code using TypeScript.\n\nFollow best practices.\n\nThe entire project should be scalable, maintainable, and ready for deployment on Vercel.\n"
    items {
      text: "Build a modern, clean, mobile-first educational website for \"Sneha Gupta (CA Finalist)\".\n\nThe design should be premium, minimal, elegant, and extremely easy for students to navigate. Avoid clutter. Use a white background with subtle blue accents (#2563EB) and soft gray tones. Rounded corners, clean typography, smooth animations, and professional spacing throughout.\n\nTechnology Stack:\n- Next.js 15 (App Router)\n- TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS\n- shadcn/ui\n- Lucide React Icons\n- React Hook Form\n- Zod Validation\n- Supabase (Authentication, PostgreSQL Database, Storage)\n- Razorpay Payment Gateway\n- Vercel Deployment\n\nThe website should include the following pages:\n\n====================\nHOME PAGE\n====================\n\nHero Section\n- Branding: Sneha Gupta (CA Finalist)\n- Professional portrait placeholder\n- Short introduction\n- Motivational headline\n- CTA buttons:\n  - Explore Courses\n  - Join Mentorship\n  - Book Strategy Session\n\nBelow the hero include\n\n\342\200\242 Why Study With Sneha\n\342\200\242 Featured Courses\n\342\200\242 Mentorship Programs\n\342\200\242 Strategy Session\n\342\200\242 Student Testimonials\n\342\200\242 FAQ\n\342\200\242 Contact Section\n\342\200\242 Footer\n\n====================\nCOURSES PAGE\n====================\n\nDisplay chapter-wise courses in beautiful cards.\n\nEach course card contains\n\n- Thumbnail\n- Chapter Name\n- Description\n- Duration\n- Price\n- Buy Now button\n\nCourse Detail Page\n\nInclude\n\n- Course description\n- Chapter list\n- Video Preview\n- Buy Now\n- PDF Notes\n- Question Bank PDF\n- Student Reviews\n\nAfter purchase\n\nStudents should get\n\n- Video Access\n- Download Notes\n- Question Bank\n- Progress Tracking\n- Continue Watching\n\n====================\nMENTORSHIP PAGE\n====================\n\nDisplay mentorship options\n\nCA Inter Sept 2026\n\nSingle Group\n\342\202\2711500\n\nBoth Groups\n\342\202\2712000\n\nCA Inter Jan 2027\n\nSingle Group\n\342\202\2713000\n\nBoth Groups\n\342\202\2714000\n\nEach mentorship page should include\n\n- Full Description\n- Benefits\n- Weekly Plan\n- Personal Guidance\n- Doubt Support\n- Timetable\n- FAQ\n- Enroll Now button\n\nAfter payment\n\nDisplay Student Information Form\n\nCollect\n\n- Name\n- Email\n- Mobile\n- Attempt\n- College\n- Current Preparation Level\n\n====================\nPERSONAL STRATEGY SESSION\n====================\n\nPrice \342\202\271799\n\nExplain\n\n- 1:1 Strategy Call\n- Personalized Study Planner\n- Subject-wise Planning\n- Backlog Recovery\n- Revision Plan\n- Remaining Days Action Plan\n\nInclude\n\nBook Now button\n\nBooking Form\n\nChoose\n\n- Date\n- Time\n- Contact Number\n\n====================\nSTUDENT REVIEWS\n====================\n\nBeautiful testimonial section\n\nSupport\n\n- Text Reviews\n- Images\n- WhatsApp Screenshots\n- Ratings\n\nAdmin should easily add more reviews.\n\n====================\nLOGIN\n====================\n\nAuthentication using Supabase\n\nEmail Login\n\nRegister\n\nForgot Password\n\n====================\nSTUDENT DASHBOARD\n====================\n\nAfter login students only see purchased products.\n\nDashboard contains\n\n- My Courses\n- Continue Learning\n- Progress Bar\n- Notes\n- Question Banks\n- Purchased Mentorship\n- Strategy Session Booking\n- Profile\n- Logout\n\n====================\nVIDEO PLAYER\n====================\n\nProfessional learning page\n\nFeatures\n\n- Large Video Player\n- Sidebar Chapter List\n- Previous\n- Next\n- Mark Complete\n- Resume Playback\n- Progress Bar\n\n====================\nADMIN PANEL\n====================\n\nCreate a protected admin dashboard.\n\nAdmin can\n\n- Upload Videos\n- Upload PDFs\n- Add Chapters\n- Create Courses\n- Edit Courses\n- Delete Courses\n- Change Prices\n- Manage Mentorship Programs\n- Manage Strategy Sessions\n- Add Testimonials\n- View Students\n- View Purchases\n- View Payments\n- Manage Users\n\n====================\nDATABASE\n====================\n\nCreate tables\n\nUsers\n\nCourses\n\nChapters\n\nVideos\n\nPDFs\n\nPurchases\n\nProgress\n\nMentorship\n\nStrategySessions\n\nTestimonials\n\nPayments\n\n====================\nPAYMENTS\n====================\n\nIntegrate Razorpay.\n\nAfter successful payment\n\n- Verify Payment\n- Save Purchase\n- Unlock Course\n- Send Confirmation Email\n\n====================\nDESIGN\n====================\n\nUse\n\n- Tailwind CSS\n- shadcn/ui\n- Framer Motion\n- Lucide Icons\n\nThe UI should feel similar to premium platforms like:\n- Unacademy\n- Physics Wallah\n- Graphy\n- Airtribe\n\nFeatures\n\n- Glassmorphism where appropriate\n- Beautiful gradients\n- Smooth animations\n- Mobile Responsive\n- Dark mode support\n- SEO optimized\n- Fast loading\n- Accessibility compliant\n\n====================\nCODE QUALITY\n====================\n\nUse reusable components.\n\nCreate folders for\n\n/components\n/app\n/lib\n/hooks\n/types\n/services\n/utils\n\nWrite clean production-ready code using TypeScript.\n\nFollow best practices.\n\nThe entire project should be scalable, maintainable, and ready for deployment on Vercel.\n"
    }
  }
}
