    modified_response: "I have built the educational website for **Sneha Gupta (CA Finalist)**.\n\n### Design & Aesthetic Highlights\n- **Clean Educational Palette**: Framed with a crisp white canvas, soft slate backgrounds (`#F8FAFC`), and subtle blue accents (`#2563EB`) paired with high-contrast typography.\n- **Responsive & Mobile-First**: Spaced layouts with 44px+ touch targets, responsive drawer menus, and fluid grids adapted for mobile devices, tablets, and desktop displays.\n- **Interactive UI Components**: Custom-designed Razorpay payment checkout modal with confetti, embedded PDF notes reader, LMS video player layout, and automated study planner.\n\n---\n\n### Core Functional Scope Implemented\n\n1. **Home Page**:\n   - **Hero Section**: Features Sneha Gupta\'s professional badge, key stats (5,000+ aspirants mentored, 94% pass rate), motivational tagline, and CTAs (*Explore Courses*, *Join Mentorship*, *Book Strategy Session*).\n   - **Core Pillars**: Highlights exam-oriented study methods, smart section mnemonics, 24/7 WhatsApp doubt support, and handwritten revision notes.\n   - **Featured Courses & Mentorship**: Carousel and preview cards leading to chapter breakdowns and enrollment.\n   - **Student Reviews & FAQ**: Verified marksheet scores, WhatsApp feedback overlays, and interactive accordions.\n\n2. **Courses & Fastrack Learning**:\n   - **Chapter-Wise Course Catalog**: Displays courses with thumbnails, subject filters, price discounts, duration, and rating badges.\n   - **Course Detail Modal**: Chapter breakdowns, video previews, handwritten notes, and RTP/MTP question banks.\n   - **Post-Purchase Access**: Instant unlock on payment with progress percentage tracking, video completion toggles, and downloadable PDF notes.\n\n3. **Mentorship Programs**:\n   - **CA Inter Sept 2026**: Single Group (\342\202\2711,500) and Both Groups (\342\202\2712,000).\n   - **CA Inter Jan 2027**: Single Group (\342\202\2713,000) and Both Groups (\342\202\2714,000).\n   - **Student Information Form**: Collects student name, email, mobile number, attempt, college, and current preparation level post-payment.\n\n4. **1:1 Personal Strategy Session (\342\202\271799)**:\n   - Covers 1:1 strategy calls, subject-wise planning, backlog recovery, and remaining days action plans.\n   - Interactive date & time slot booking form integrated with Razorpay payment processing.\n\n5. **Student Reviews & Testimonials**:\n   - Visual testimonial wall featuring star ratings, exam scores, and WhatsApp feedback screenshots.\n   - Admin modal allowing new student reviews to be added dynamically.\n\n6. **LMS Video Player**:\n   - Full video learning interface with playback controls, sidebar chapter playlist, previous/next lesson navigation, \"Mark Complete\" toggle, and embedded notes tab.\n\n7. **Student Dashboard**:\n   - Tabbed view showing only unlocked courses, continue learning links, progress bars, PDF notes downloads, purchased mentorship status, strategy session meeting links, and profile settings.\n\n8. **Protected Admin Panel**:\n   - Full management tools to create/edit/delete courses, add chapters and video links, adjust mentorship prices, review student strategy calls, add testimonials, and audit Razorpay payment logs.\n   - Includes a quick **\"Admin Mode\" toggle** in the top navigation bar for instant testing.\n\n9. **Razorpay Payment Gateway Simulation**:\n   - Simulated checkout interface supporting UPI, QR code scanning, debit/credit cards, and netbanking with instant verification and transaction receipts."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
