    modified_response: "The **Clean Minimalism** design theme has been applied across the application:\n\n- **Visual Palette & Typography**: Transformed the color system to feature a clean white background paired with vibrant blue accents (`#2563EB`), crisp neutral borders, soft pill badges, and refined typography scale.\n- **Header & Navigation**: Updated the brand logo to a crisp `#2563EB` icon with a clean typography hierarchy, streamlined desktop menu links, pill buttons, and interactive dark/light mode toggling.\n- **Hero Section**: Designed a spacious layout featuring a dot-pill badge, bold headline, primary blue CTA buttons with shadow depth (`shadow-blue-500/25`), secondary outline buttons, quick stats strip, and a portrait frame with soft floating badges and blur highlights.\n- **Courses & Mentorship**: Formatted course cards, filter tabs, and mentorship plans with soft rounded corners, high-contrast badges, clear pricing hierarchy, and smooth hover interactions.\n- **Component Preservation**: Maintained all underlying application logic, Razorpay payment flows, 1:1 strategy booking modal, interactive study planner, student dashboard, and admin panel capabilities."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
